00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:08,350
gCaptain reports that Chinese container shipping companies may see stronger profits as freight rates rise.

2
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:18,035
Shippers moved goods early before tariff changes, while Red Sea and Strait of Hormuz risks kept routes costly and uncertain.

3
00:00:18,035 --> 00:00:27,741
Analysts say higher spot rates help carriers now, but extra ship capacity and future trade tensions could pressure earnings later.

